B.ayj=new A.c(B.azf,["Local data is locked","The app could not open the data stored on this device: the encryption key held by the system no longer matches the files on disk. This can happen after an app or operating system update.","The app could not finish an upgrade step on your local data and stopped rather than damage it. Your data is still on this device: in most cases retrying or reopening the app is enough.","Your data has not been deleted: it is still on this device, and nothing will remove it automatically.","Close and reopen the app, or restart the device: on some systems the secure keystore only becomes readable after the first unlock. If the problem persists, write to support@plurifin.app quoting the code below.","Support code","Technical details","The data is still not accessible.","Start over and delete local data","Delete local data?","This permanently deletes portfolios, goals, settings, consents and subscription state from this device. It cannot be undone and does not touch backups you have exported.","Delete everything","The operation could not be completed.","Nothing was deleted. The app could not verify the result of the deletion and stopped rather than destroy the only key that can still read your data: your data is still on this device. Try again after restarting the device, or write to support@plurifin.app quoting the code above.","The deletion could not be completed. Part of the local data may already have been deleted; what remains is still on this device, and the app kept the only key that can still read it. Try again after restarting the device, or write to support@plurifin.app quoting the code above.","Retry","Cancel"],t.w)
